        <object id="first" label="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:21px&quot;&gt;4.1 · 首轮预测重叠纠偏&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;ContactStrategy.PlanInitialOffsets 生成 pendingOffsets。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;管理器 ApplyPendingOffsets；预测快照保持原样。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="../../Assets/Script/Framworker/Function/Physics/Mgr/PhysicsSolverMgr.cs" tooltip="Assets/Script/Framworker/Function/Physics/Mgr/PhysicsSolverMgr.cs · ContactForSolution">
